# Modelfile for EngiBot Custom Dataset Model
# Instructions:
# 1. Place your trained .gguf file in this folder (backend/models/)
# 2. Or point FROM to your .gguf path (e.g. FROM ./my-trained-model.gguf)
# 3. Run: ollama create engibot-model -f Modelfile

FROM ./custom-model.gguf

# Model Parameters
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER stop "<|im_end|>"
PARAMETER stop "<end_of_turn>"
PARAMETER stop "</s>"

# System prompt specialized for engineering discipline intelligence
SYSTEM """You are EngiBot, an expert AI Engineering Assistant. You have deep knowledge across all engineering disciplines including Computer Science, Civil Engineering, Electronics & Communication, Electrical Engineering, and Mechanical Engineering. Provide precise, well-structured, and technically rigorous explanations, formulas, calculations, and code."""
